<view class="page with-action"><state-view status="{{status}}" title="{{status==='empty'?'诗文暂时不可用':''}}" message="{{error || '请返回成长诗列表查看。'}}" actionText="{{status==='empty'?'返回列表':'重试'}}" bind:retry="load" bind:action="back"/><block wx:if="{{status==='ready'}}"><view class="card poem-paper"><image class="poem-cover reading-cover" src="{{poem.cover_url || '/assets/landscape.svg'}}" mode="aspectFill" binderror="coverError"/><view class="poem-reading"><view class="row between"><text class="small">写给{{poem.student_name || '正在长大的你'}} · {{poem.period}}</text><view class="tag ai">AI 生成</view></view><view class="poem-title">{{poem.title}}</view><view class="verse">{{poem.content}}</view><view class="signature">这首诗，来自观察与陪伴留下的足迹。
诗文由 AI 生成，{{poem.cover_url?'封面由接口提供':'封面为本地品牌插画'}}。</view></view></view><view class="notice"><image class="icon" src="/assets/icons/shield.svg"/><text>分享卡默认隐藏昵称；不包含学校、成长分数或陪伴照片。</text></view></block><view wx:if="{{status==='ready'}}" class="bottom-action"><button class="btn secondary" bindtap="generate">再写一首</button><button class="btn" bindtap="share">分享这首诗</button></view></view>